#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
If you are **Spanish Speedcubing Association (AES)** member on June 14, 2025 and you participate in the competition, you will be reimbursed €1.50 of the registration fee at the end of the competition. You can join AES by clicking [here](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).
